.page fgrep 1 grep for fixed strings

# SYNOPSIS
*fgrep* [_OPTION_...] _STRING_ [_FILE_...]

# DESCRIPTION
`fgrep` is `grep -F`: the pattern is taken literally, with no special characters. All the options of grep(1) are accepted.

# EXAMPLES
    fgrep '*.c' Makefile
    fgrep -f words.txt text.txt

# SEE ALSO
grep(1), egrep(1)
